$(3)$ holds by the linearity of expectation and the definition of conditional mutual information.

We re-index both the sets $[b_r] \setminus \rSrow$ and $[b_r] \setminus \rScol$ as $[b_r \cdot \alpha + 1]$ for ease of exposition just for this final part of the proof. 
